Question 14: Delhi’s Traffic and Air Quality

AIM: Combine weekly logs, compute correlation, and weekly mean PM2.5.

Code:
import pandas as pd

week1 = pd.DataFrame({'vehicles_k': [30, 35, 40, 45], 'pm25': [52, 55, 60, 63]})
week2 = pd.DataFrame({'vehicles_k': [50, 55, 60, 65], 'pm25': [68, 72, 75, 80]})

combined = pd.concat([week1, week2], ignore_index=True)
combined['week'] = ['Week1']*len(week1) + ['Week2']*len(week2)

print("Combined shape:", combined.shape)

corr = combined['vehicles_k'].corr(combined['pm25'])
print("Correlation:", round(corr,3))

means = combined.groupby('week')['pm25'].mean()
print("\nWeekly mean PM2.5:\n", means)

